Length [text box] - Turnplate
Type the Length of the Turnplate into the text box.
Remarks
After you inserted it, Plant Simulation shows its length here. The Turnplate only rotates MUs, which it can
accommodate in their entirety, meaning that they are shorter or as long as the value you enter here.
You can change the length of the graphic and the anchor points of the Turnplate by clicking Show
Manipulators 
  on the Edit ribbon tab or by pressing M on the keyboard.
