Angle [text box] - Turnplate
Type the Angle in degrees into the text box to which the Turnplate rotates the MU.
Remarks
The rotation angle should be a multiple of 90. If you type in an angle other than that, Plant Simulation
rounds this angle to the next angle that is divisible by 90. You can also type in a value greater than 360
degrees as long as it is divisible by 90. This way the turnplate can rotate the part several times around its
own axis to simulate packing machines.
By default, the turnplate rotates the part 90 degrees clockwise. To rotate the part counter-clockwise, type
in negative angles.
