Tabs Menu
Use the commands of the Tabs menu to show or hide individual tabs of the selected material flow objects.
If you hide tabs that you do not need, Plant Simulation opens the dialog faster, and you can change to
those tabs faster that you need in your daily work.
Remarks
To apply the changed settings, click OK, close the dialog, and reopen it
The menu shows a check mark to the left of the displayed tabs.
The command Inherit turns inheritance of the displayed or hidden tabs in the dialog off or on.
